All 15 tests pass now. Here's what was fixed in `src/`:

**`src/auth.py`:**
- `has_permission`: used case-insensitive comparison via `.lower()` instead of exact string match.
- `is_admin_or_owner`: changed `and` to `or` — admin status and owner status are independent grants.

**`src/inventory.py`:**
- `__init__`: removed mutable default argument `{}`; now copies any passed dict to avoid shared state.
- `add`: changed assignment to accumulation (`+=`) so repeated calls stack.
- `reserve`: changed `>=` to `>` so reserving exactly the available amount is allowed.
- `release`: added guard to raise `ValueError` when releasing more than currently reserved.

**`src/text_utils.py`:**
- `slugify`: appended `.lower()` to alphanumeric characters; added a `while` loop to fully collapse repeated hyphens instead of a single `.replace("--", "-")`.
- `truncate`: subtracted `len(suffix)` from the slice so total output respects `max_len`.
